; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Affixes. Low and High are the least and the most it rolls at item level 1 and
; at 15, drawn straight between. Prefix names a magic thing: "O'tkir qisqa qilich".
; Each is the engine's Affix (E43) and counts while the thing is worn. ATTRIBUTE
; is the thing's own attribute, or one drawn among the three; Also is what it brings with it, fixed.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

